      "label": "rainbow-colored smiling face emoji",
      "description": "A circular emoji with a smiling face, featuring horizontal stripes in the colors of the rainbow flag (red, orange, yellow, green, blue, purple), symbolizing LGBTQ+ identity. The emoji wears black-rimmed glasses, which are a common visual trope in memes to suggest intelligence, nerdiness, or a 'meme lord' persona. The eyes are large and cartoonish, and the smile is wide and simple. This emoji is the central visual element of the image.",
