      "label": "The rainbow emoji is mapped as the 'gay friend' and 'meme lord'",
      "description": "The text 'when you're the gay friend and also the meme lord' explicitly identifies the visual entity (the rainbow emoji) as embodying both identities. The rainbow stripes visually map to 'gay friend' (via LGBTQ+ Pride Flag symbolism), and the glasses map to 'meme lord' (via Glasses_as_a_Meme_Trope). This creates an analogical mapping where the visual entity is projected as the subject of the text's description.",
