      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the gay meme lord scene",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the central visual entity (the rainbow emoji with glasses) which is explicitly identified in the text as 'the gay friend and also the meme lord'. The text 'when you're...' directly addresses the viewer, creating a self-referential projection where the user sees themselves as the subject of the description. The projection is onto the visual material (emoji) and the scene (gay_meme_lord_scene), which together form the entity embodying the dual identity.",
